Ripe’s integration with Base is further enhanced by its compatibility with WalletConnect, a protocol that connects wallets to dApps across multiple chains, including Base. Users can connect their preferred wallets (e.g., Coinbase Wallet, MetaMask) to Ripe via WalletConnect, enabling secure and seamless interactions with the protocol. This integration simplifies onboarding for Base users, making Ripe’s lending platform accessible to both crypto-native and mainstream audiences.

